Third-party method
------------------
NotAWatchFaceDigital/source/Astro.mc calculates sunrise and sunset with the
published "Sunrise/Sunset Algorithm":

    https://edwilliams.org/sunrise_sunset_algorithm.htm

That page attributes the method to the Almanac for Computers, 1990, published
by the Nautical Almanac Office, United States Naval Observatory. The page
states no usage terms. This notice credits the method and its publisher.


